║  11. EVENTS — Thiếu so với EnsoulSharp (ƯU TIÊN #2)                      ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
Source: EnsoulSharp.SDK/Core/Events/

[  ] 11.1 Gapcloser Detection                                    🔴 HIGH
         Source: Events/Gapcloser.cs + Resources/Data/Gapclosers.json
         - OnGapCloser event → fire when enemy dashes toward ally
         - GapCloserEventArgs: Sender, Slot, StartPos, EndPos, Speed
         - Database of gapcloser spells per champion (JSON data copied)
         - Detect via OnProcessSpellCast → match against database

[  ] 11.2 Interruptable Spell Detection                          🔴 HIGH
         Source: Events/InterruptableSpell.cs + InterruptableSpells.json
         - OnInterruptableTarget event → fire when enemy channels
         - InterruptableTargetEventArgs: Sender, Slot, DangerLevel
         - Database of interruptable spells (JSON data copied)
         - Detect via ActiveSpellCast polling

[  ] 11.3 Dash Detection                                         🔴 HIGH
         Source: Events/Dash.cs
         - OnDash event → fire when any hero dashes
         - DashArgs: Sender, StartPos, EndPos, Speed, Duration, IsBlink
         - Detect via waypoint changes + speed threshold

[  ] 11.4 Stealth Detection                                      🟡 MEDIUM
         Source: Events/Stealth.cs
         - OnStealth event → fire when hero goes invisible
         - StealthEventArgs: Sender, IsStealthed, Time
         - Detect via IsVisible() state change

[  ] 11.5 Teleport/Recall Improved                               🟡 MEDIUM
         Source: Events/Teleport.cs (439 lines — covers TP, Recall, Shen R, TF R)
         - Hiện tại RecallTracker chỉ detect recall bằng buff
         - Cần: detect Teleport, Shen R, TF R, Hexgate
         - TeleportEventArgs: NetworkId, Status, Type, Duration, Start

[  ] 11.6 Turret Aggro Events                                    🟡 MEDIUM
         Source: Events/Turret.cs
         - OnTurretTargetChange event
         - Track turret → target mapping per frame

